Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:59.40,Title,0,0,0,0,,《超凡蜘蛛侠》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,5 4 3\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, four, three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.23,0:01:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,2 1\N{\fnArial\fs30}…two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 我来咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready or not, here I come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.97,0:02:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.34,0:03:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跟你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll stay with Aunt May…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯父伯母住一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Uncle Ben for a little while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想和你们一起 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanna go with you. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.29,0:03:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,做三明治要去掉面包皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't like crust on his sandwiches…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上睡觉他喜欢留点光\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and he likes to sleep with a little light on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽 走吧 走吧 - 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mary. Come on, come on. - Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,要听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 弗莱舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, Flash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你是彼得 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. It's Peter, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.70,0:04:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常喜欢你的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really like your photos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thanks. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你周五晚上有空吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are you busy Friday night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 你能给我男朋友的车拍些照片么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. Can you take pictures of my boyfriend's car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我就是想挑张好的裱起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I really wanna frame a good one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,送给他当生日礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for his birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他可真好啊 喔 想法非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's really nice of you. wow, that's such a nice thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.51,0:04:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我会看一下我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll have a look at the old…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的时间表 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The old schedule. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:04:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了老师 - 你还想要你的滑板么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir? - You want to keep that skateboard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要的 - 那就轮子朝天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Keep it off the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 嗯 - 别着地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. Yeah. - Wheels up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃掉 吃掉 吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat it! Eat it! Eat it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃掉 吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat it! Eat it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃掉 吃掉 吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat it! Eat it! Eat it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的菜吃掉 戈登 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat your vegetables, Gordon. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 帕克 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Parker, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a picture of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不会拍这种照片 把他放下来 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not gonna take a picture of it. Put him down, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.71,0:05:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 戈登 别吃 别吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Gordon, don't eat it, don't eat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍一张吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.49,0:05:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放他下来 弗莱舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him down, Flash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:05:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下他 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him down, Eugene!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来啊帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, Parker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会拍那照片的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still not taking the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.49,0:06:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴着吧 帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down, Parker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁敢挡我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants one more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来啊 - 弗莱舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One more! - Flash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flash…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.58,0:06:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天放学计划仍旧不变吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we still on for after school today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家 三点半\N{\fnArial\fs30}My house, 3:30?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你做了作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you did homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time, I was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你可非常失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}…disappointed in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行啊 闪开 - 不 咱先去上课怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, move. - No, how about we go to class?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.87,0:06:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你刚刚做的很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that was great what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was stupid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it was great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.47,0:07:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好去一趟医务室 你可能会得脑震荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go to the nurse. You might have a concussion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我的名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know my name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.03,0:07:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想知道你还知不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know if you know your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕克 彼得？帕克 - 好的 好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Parker. Peter Parker. - Okay. Okay, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我还是会去医务室的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd still go to the nurse though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是格温 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Gwen, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温·斯泰茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen Stacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.95,0:07:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.51,0:07:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚做意面和肉丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm making spaghetti and meatballs tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗 意大利面和肉丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious? Spaghetti and meatballs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候开始不喜欢意面和肉丸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when don't you like spaghetti and meatballs, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.59,0:08:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦我的天 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.81,0:08:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 摔一跤而已 滑板的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right. Just… I fell, skating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,本恩·帕克 你想把这脏兮兮的盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben Parker, don't you even…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢在我的厨房里门都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}…think about leaving that filthy box in my kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些可是我的保龄球奖品\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bowling trophies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 那当然可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, then, by all means…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请一定要把这脏兮兮的盒子放在厨房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Ieave that box in my kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事了你 - 他摔倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to you? - He fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来都搞不懂小屁孩为什么要玩那些玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you kids ride those things, I'll never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那很傻很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's stupid and dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我们犯傻的时候么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when we were stupid and dangerous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.81,0:08:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 相信我 我们是过来人 - 好吧 很高兴知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trust me, we were. - All right. Good to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里发洪水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the flood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上 我带你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me. I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.23,0:08:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You serious? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是冷凝器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it's the condenser tray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,水太多 损坏了冷凝器或者热传导管道系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much water for the condenser tray or the heat exchange tubing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是没过水位线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has got to be the fill line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这才说的通\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only thing that makes any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能修好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you fix it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 今晚不行 我明天去趟五金店\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not tonight. I'll go by the hardware store tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.54,0:08:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 顺便把这个敷脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good deal. And meanwhile, put this on your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个动手的家伙怎样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the other guy look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:09:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 我一看就知道怎么回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I know a right cross when I see one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.57,0:09:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,说还是不说 要我打小报告给你爹地么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes or no? Do I have to call somebody's father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会告诉你梅伯母的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wouldn't tell your Aunt May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,惹火她的小鬼都太可怜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pity the poor kid who'd have to suffer her wrath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.65,0:09:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你上来之前 再看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you come up, see if…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有没有修一下还能再用的东西 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …there's anything else worth saving. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 水管工不负责修家电啊 - 不 他们也修的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Plumbers don't fix appliances. - Yes, they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只负责修管子和抽水\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fix pipes and pump things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你让他们修\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask them to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.93,0:09:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都把那东西忘光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot all about that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was your dad's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 他叫我们替他好好保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - He asked us to keep it safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在第九大道上的一家皮具店的橱窗里看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw it in the window of that leather shop over on 9th Avenue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,才19岁 一个19岁的小孩要个公文包干嘛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was 19. What does a 19-year-old kid need with a briefcase?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜谁卖给他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guess who sold it to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - Your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是这么认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how they met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让你 好好保管 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked you to keep this safe? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面什么都没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.57,0:10:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过这包么 什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you looked? There's nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸是个很神秘的人 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father was a very secretive man, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.99,0:10:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.87,0:10:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是谁么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who that is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你爸爸一起工作的同事 我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some guy who worked with your dad, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这从桌上拿开吧 好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take this off the table, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃饭了 拿走 然后去洗手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna eat. Off. And wash your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做个好孩子 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to be a good boy. Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你妈妈有些事必须要去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}…something your mom and I have to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.85,0:12:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,零 零 衰变率算法\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Zero, zero, decay rate algorithm."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.68,0:12:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 马上来 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, one sec, one sec.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好着呢 怎么了 - 哦天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. What's up? - Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.77,0:12:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和他太像了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能进来吗 - 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I come in? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:12:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读的书不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I don't have much education.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.07,0:13:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 你十岁时做的功课我就已经不知道怎么辅导了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I stopped being able to help with your homework when you were 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm trying to say is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.54,0:13:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道爸爸不在身边的日子很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I know it's been rough for you without your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道我们很少谈他们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know we don't talk much about them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 没关系 - 不 当然有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, it's all right. - No, it is not all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望可以改变 但是我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could change it, but I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯特？康纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curt Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是照片上站在你爸旁边那人的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the name of the guy in the picture with your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一起工作了很多年 关系很铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They worked together for years and they were close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.84,0:13:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那晚之后我们再没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after that night, we never saw him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.11,0:13:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至没打过电话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never even called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去查查看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go figure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.87,0:13:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,本恩伯伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个很好的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a pretty great dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能为您效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 呃 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I'm here to see…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是来见康纳斯博士的 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …Dr. Connors. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在左手边那儿找一下你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find yourself to the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来这实习的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are here for the internship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.10,0:15:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你的名牌 左手边位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find your badge to the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.65,0:15:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到你自己的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having trouble finding yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Yeah, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.25,0:15:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,格韦拉先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Mr. Guevara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gracias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}De Nada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.19,0:15:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到奥斯集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Oscorp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,由创始人 诺曼？奥斯本 创建\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born from the mind of our founder, Norman Osborn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯集团大厦有108层 层层都有新科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}… the Oscorp Tower houses 108 floors of innovation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们运用科技头脑不断拓宽 防御工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our scientific minds are pushing the boundaries of defence, biomedical…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.65,0:15:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物医学和化学科技的界限 未来由我们创造\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and chemical technologies. The future lies within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到奥斯集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Oscorp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字是格温·斯泰茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Gwen Stacy, a senior…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是中城科技高中的毕业班学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at Midtown Science…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是康纳斯博士的实习生领队\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and head intern to Dr. Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以参观期间我会一直和你们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll be with you for the duration of your visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.77,0:15:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去哪 你们跟到哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I go, you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.86,0:15:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是基本规矩 你们只要记住这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the rule. Remember that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:15:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就一切好说 - 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …all will be fine. - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:15:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是忘了的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf you forget that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们真正的罗德里戈？格韦拉在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them Rodrigo Guevara is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快告诉他们罗德里戈？格韦拉在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell them Rodrigo Guevara is here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.03,0:16:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是罗德里戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Rodrigo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜现在不用我说忘了之后的下场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I don't need to tell you what happens if you forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.05,0:16:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come around this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好 格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, Gwen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.43,0:16:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字是柯蒂斯·康纳斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Dr. Curtis Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 以防你们疑惑 我是个左撇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, in case you're wondering, I'm a southpaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.31,0:16:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是个残废\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a cripple…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个科学家 而且我在世界爬虫学界中首屈一指\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm a scientist, and the world's foremost authority on herpetology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.59,0:16:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,给不明白的人解释一下 也就是爬行动物学\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's reptiles, for those of you who don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像帕金森病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the Parkinson's patient…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧地看着自己的身体渐渐不听使唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who watches on in horror as her body…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是患有眼部黄斑恶化的病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…slowly betrays her, or the man with macular degeneration…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,视野日渐暗淡 我渴望修复自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whose eyes grow dimmer each day, I long to fix myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望创造一个没有弱点的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to create a world without weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:17:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人敢猜猜这要如何实现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone care to venture a guess just how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,干细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stem cells?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有希望 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promising. But the solution…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.14,0:17:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想的方法更加 彻底\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm thinking of is more radical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人知道么 - 跨物种遗传学\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one? - Cross-species genetics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Person gets Parkinson's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,产生多巴胺的脑细胞开始消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when the brain cells that produce dopamine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们就会患上帕金森\N{\fnArial\fs30}…start to disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.76,0:17:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是斑马鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a zebra fish has the ability…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有令细胞再生的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to regenerate cells on command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could give this ability…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这能力给予你提到的那个女人 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to the woman you're talking about, that's that. She's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.24,0:17:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就能治愈自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's curing herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你只要给她脖子上装个腮就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you just have to look past the gills on her neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是中城科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of Midtown Science's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最聪明的学生之一 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …best and brightest. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.22,0:17:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是班上的第二名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second in his class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第二名 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Second? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.52,0:17:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:17:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思有事要处理 你们就跟着才华洋溢的斯泰茜小姐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid duty calls. I'll leave you in the more-than-capable hands of Miss Stacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice meeting you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.57,0:18:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以过来围过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd like to gather round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到奥斯集团生命树\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Oscorp's tree of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.09,0:18:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们星球的生命树是十分混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our planet's tree of life is immense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在奥斯集团的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Oscorp's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.29,0:18:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跨物种部门中 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …Cross-Species Division… - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们努力探索激动人心的新研究方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we endeavour to explore exciting new methods…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛呢 罗德里戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, "Rodrigo"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.81,0:18:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这工作 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work here. I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.51,0:18:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算说我在这工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna say I work here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.69,0:18:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但似乎实际上你是在这工作的 所以你其实知道我不在这工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it seems like you do work here. So you know that I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟踪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You following me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我没有跟踪你 我可不知道你在这工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not following you, no. I had no idea you worked here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么在这里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you be here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偷溜进来是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just snuck in because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱科学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你爱科学 - 我爱死它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You love it. - I'm passionate about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.83,0:18:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷溜进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you snuck in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.66,0:18:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得带这组参观 - 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to lead this tour group. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.70,0:18:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚点我再详细问你 别给我添麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ask you more about this later. Do not get me in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:18:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我保证不会的 - 跟紧队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I promise you I won't. - Stay with the group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 同学们 我要带你们去生物反应堆房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys? I'm gonna take you to the bioreactor room now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.80,0:19:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Yo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.19,0:19:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.55,0:21:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今早收到了信使核糖核酸序列的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}We received the results from the mRNA sequences this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很令人失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were disappointing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.83,0:21:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫令人失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define "disappointing."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.34,0:21:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一个死链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another dead end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.56,0:21:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是衰变率算法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the decay rate algorithm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是预料之中的 - 预料之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And this is to be expected. - Expected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说就快成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.38,0:21:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很快了 但是也要花点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are close, but it's gonna take time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.03,0:22:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.20,0:22:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺曼？奥斯本快死了 康纳斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norman Osborn is dying, Dr. Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.24,0:22:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.90,0:22:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然咱都得掉脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we'll both lose our heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 给我名牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, give me the badge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.09,0:22:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.88,0:22:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.32,0:23:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心 我现在一身啤酒味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disgusting. Now I smell like beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.99,0:23:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.24,0:23:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.55,0:23:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是 我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't… I didn't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.27,0:23:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手从她身上拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hand off her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.84,0:23:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to get my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.50,0:23:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.44,0:23:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.80,0:23:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.44,0:24:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 揍他 鲁迪 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, get him, Rudy! - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.53,0:24:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.14,0:24:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.62,0:24:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 撂倒他 - 上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take him down! - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.48,0:24:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,揍他 老兄 揍他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him, man! Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.04,0:24:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 亲 别动我的滑板\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, no. Not my board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.57,0:24:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 哥们儿 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, dude, don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.32,0:24:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.20,0:24:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.54,0:24:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.84,0:24:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尼岛 到站了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coney Island, next stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.50,0:24:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一站终点站 科尼岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next and final stop, Coney Island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.48,0:24:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.21,0:24:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.68,0:24:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我回来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.99,0:24:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去了 - 我们很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got… - We've been so worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.93,0:24:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:24:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.28,0:25:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个苍蝇 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a fly, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.86,0:25:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.55,0:25:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.90,0:25:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们等这么晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I kept you guys up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.13,0:25:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我反应迟钝 我不负责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm insensitive, I'm irresponsible…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.51,0:25:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在很饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I'm hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.29,0:25:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞士肉卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meat loaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.52,0:25:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝多了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.87,0:25:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.78,0:25:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.86,0:25:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的瑞士肉卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your meat loaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.37,0:25:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是瑞士肉卷里的战斗卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This beats all other meat loafs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.50,0:25:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,出大事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something is very wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.97,0:25:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.34,0:25:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人喜欢吃你的肉卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody likes your meat loaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.68,0:25:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.93,0:26:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿了冻意粉和冻奶酪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took the frozen macaroni and cheese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.21,0:26:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不告诉我你不喜欢我的瑞士肉卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me you didn't like my meat loaf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.32,0:26:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,37年前你就该告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have said that to me 37 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.46,0:26:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都做了多少瑞士肉卷给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many meat loafs have I made for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.54,0:29:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.36,0:29:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.73,0:29:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.34,0:29:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在做作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.71,0:29:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.42,0:29:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.97,0:29:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.49,0:29:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得我了 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember me. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.65,0:29:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那天的实习生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The intern from the other day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.20,0:29:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. That's right, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.59,0:29:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定你非常优秀 但这是我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you're very nice, but this is a home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.32,0:29:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想请你到我办公室预约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you to make an appointment with my office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.67,0:29:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是理查德？帕克的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Richard Parker's son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.54,0:29:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.27,0:29:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕帮不了你多少 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I can't help you much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.61,0:29:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么他们离开 也不知道他们去了哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why they left or where they were going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.09,0:30:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good reflexes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.66,0:30:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.96,0:30:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 我读了你的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - I read your book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.99,0:30:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.71,0:30:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,写得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.48,0:30:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说你真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you really think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.11,0:30:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 觉得有可能么 跨物种遗传学 - 是的 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …it's possible, cross-species genetics? - Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.99,0:30:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,外界都在嘲笑你父亲和我研究出的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father and I were mocked for our theories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.64,0:30:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止是广大群众 也包括奥斯集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just in the community at large, but at Oscorp, as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.13,0:30:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫我们疯子科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called us mad scientists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.93,0:30:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你父亲繁殖了蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then your father bred the spiders…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.48,0:30:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and everything changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.68,0:30:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果大出所料\N{\fnArial\fs30}The results were beyond encouraging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.71,0:30:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是惊世之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were spectacular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.67,0:30:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本可以改变无数人的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were gonna change the lives of millions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.19,0:30:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也包括我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.63,0:30:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it was over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.04,0:30:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.71,0:30:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着他的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took his research with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.90,0:30:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我知道 没有他我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I knew without him, l…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.91,0:31:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.25,0:31:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.73,0:31:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我远离你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I stayed away from you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.47,0:31:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.56,0:31:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for that, I'm truly sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.90,0:31:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.41,0:31:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如说这起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.24,0:31:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say you got it to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.30,0:31:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类会继承多少外来物种的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, how much would the foreign species take over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.04,0:31:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,副作用会是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could the side effects be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.77,0:31:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难说 因为还没有试验品幸存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to say, considering no subject survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.55,0:31:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题总是出在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem was always…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.85,0:31:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,衰变率算法上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The decay rate algorithm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.47,0:31:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.47,0:31:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.56,0:31:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.61,0:32:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝世之才啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extraordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.35,0:32:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you come up with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.45,0:32:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 你哪天放学后来大楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, how about coming to see me at the Tower…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.92,0:32:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和我见个面好吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …one day after school? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.37,0:32:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.56,0:33:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号 雷吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one, Reggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.57,0:33:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,传球 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run it, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.75,0:33:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上吧 雷吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Reggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.00,0:33:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rejected!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.20,0:33:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你故意的吧 弗莱舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did that on purpose, Flash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.14,0:33:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,故意的就好了 你最好小心着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've. You better watch your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.14,0:33:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.53,0:33:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.98,0:33:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出来 帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it up, Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.89,0:33:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.75,0:33:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}One sec.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.93,0:33:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丢过来 伙计 - 你干嘛不来我这拿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, man. - Why don't you take it from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.70,0:33:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.67,0:33:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 拿走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.72,0:34:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.89,0:34:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 要不这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, how about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.93,0:34:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.98,0:34:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.33,0:34:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点啊 弗莱舍 - 弗莱舍 别玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Flash. - Flash, stop playing, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.14,0:34:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快拿过来 - 快点 弗莱舍 快拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take it from him! - Come on, Flash. Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.21,0:34:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟 弗莱舍 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Flash, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.54,0:34:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 拿过来 弗莱舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! - Do it, Flash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.71,0:34:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别玩了 伙计 - 快点 弗莱舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop playing, man. - Let's go, Flash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.96,0:34:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛呢 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.25,0:34:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞啥啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.17,0:34:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧 来啊帕克 上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, bring it! Come on, Parker! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.47,0:35:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter's behaviour is just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.45,0:35:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不值得提倡\N{\fnArial\fs30}…unacceptable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.46,0:35:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会叫我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't make us pay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赔那个篮板的 - 我才不管那篮板呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …for the backboard. - I don't care about the backboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.42,0:35:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是真的么 - 啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was that true? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.54,0:35:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚听到的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I heard in there just now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.54,0:35:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你羞辱了那男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you humiliate that boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.29,0:35:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.66,0:35:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 - 但是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But… - But what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.63,0:35:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那家伙活该 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This guy deserved it. - Did he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.32,0:35:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 他是打你的那孩子么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - ls he the kid that hit you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.54,0:35:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.72,0:35:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 是的 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.34,0:35:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这就是为了报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all this is about getting even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.47,0:35:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是这样 我猜你现在肯定觉得自己特牛逼 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If so, I guess you must feel pretty good about yourself now, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.95,0:35:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right or wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.94,0:35:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我看你就这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I thought so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.28,0:35:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼 多亏了你这出小恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks to this little escapade of yours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.07,0:35:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不得不跟同事换班\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I had to change shifts at work…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.64,0:35:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你今晚9点得去接梅伯母 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so you have to pick up Aunt May tonight at 9:.00. Understood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.09,0:35:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听清楚了吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ls that understood? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.10,0:35:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.79,0:35:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看上去挺面熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.94,0:35:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你电脑里那姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the girl on your computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.62,0:35:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.18,0:36:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他电脑里有你照片 我是他的缓刑监督官\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got you on his computer. I'm his probation officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.64,0:36:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了梅伯母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget Aunt May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.16,0:36:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.44,0:36:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很有个性吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.55,0:36:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我伯父\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.99,0:36:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就爱胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a pathological liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.39,0:36:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把你认错成其他人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… He thought you were someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.92,0:36:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦天 你电脑里没有我照片么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, you don't have me on your computer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.76,0:36:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 我是说 我拍了辩论队的照片 你在辩论队里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I mean… I took a photo of the debate team, and you're in the debate team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.46,0:36:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.01,0:36:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定看到了 我在给照片润色\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he must have seen… I was touching up stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.48,0:36:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 润色 - 哎呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Touching up stuff? - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.63,0:36:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我不知道怎么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was… I'm not gonna answer that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.85,0:36:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你被开除了么 - 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get expelled? - No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.27,0:36:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没被开除 我得做社区服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't get expelled. I got community service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.74,0:36:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你想不想 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want to… I don't know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.62,0:36:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.90,0:36:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.49,0:36:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.24,0:37:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know… We could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.91,0:37:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以做点别的事 或者我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could do something else, or we could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.07,0:37:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你不介意 我们可以 - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lf you don't feel like, we could… - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.47,0:37:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 嗯 什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah, either one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.66,0:37:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.76,0:37:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.30,0:37:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 很好 听上去很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, good. Sounds good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.84,0:37:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.71,0:37:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.30,0:37:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是现在 我现在没空 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't right now, I can't right now. - Yeah, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.01,0:37:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在有点忙 - 我知道 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so busy right now. - I know, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.18,0:37:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.18,0:37:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 你知道 - 其他时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, just, you know… - Some other…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.45,0:37:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 好的 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time, all right. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.45,0:37:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回见 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.13,0:39:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有蛋白质结构 核糖体DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have protein structure, rDNA…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.34,0:39:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,色层分析 转基因学测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}…chromatography, transgenics testing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.46,0:39:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是X射线图像仪 是这世界上唯一的一台\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that's X-ray video. That's the only one on the planet. We have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.77,0:39:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那边是人类线谱鉴定器 - 我记得这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Human line testing over… - I remember that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.66,0:39:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过这个仪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen that before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.03,0:39:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,加纳利装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ganali device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.64,0:39:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我记得在我爸爸办公室的一张照片里看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I remember a picture of that in my dad's office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.21,0:39:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,原理很简单 在这上面加载一个抗原\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea was so simple. You load it with an antigen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.12,0:39:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它制造的反应云可以覆盖于附近一带 甚至整个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}It creates a cloud which can be dispersed over a neighbourhood, even a city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.21,0:39:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上来说 你可以用一个下午治好整个城市里的小儿麻痹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically, you could cure polio in an afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.80,0:39:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.68,0:39:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也有人反对使用 万一这个机器加载了某种有毒物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, others disagreed. What if the device were loaded with a toxin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.21,0:39:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你不想参与治疗了 你也没法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you wanted to opt out? You can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.78,0:39:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃出这个反应云范围 所以它被弃置在此 任尘土掩埋\N{\fnArial\fs30}…run away from a cloud after all, so here it lies, gathering dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.71,0:39:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里看到的 是一只蜥蜴的电脑模型\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you see here is a computer model of a lizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.37,0:39:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多这样的美妙生物已能完美适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of these wonderful creatures have so brilliantly adapted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.73,0:39:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们可以随意再生出完整的肢体\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that they can regenerate entire limbs at will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.49,0:39:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以想象我有多妒忌它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can imagine my envy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.36,0:39:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在尝试着驾驭这种能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to harness this capability…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.54,0:39:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这种能力转到实验对象身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and transfer it into our host subject:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.03,0:40:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷迪 三条腿的老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy the three-legged mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.23,0:40:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,输入方程式吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enter the algorithm now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.58,0:40:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要接电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to take that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.40,0:40:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统已准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}System ready…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.64,0:40:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因转化\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for gene insertion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.49,0:40:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.34,0:40:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.52,0:40:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what I'm trying to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.12,0:40:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 替换蛋白质 - 消除免疫反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Preempt the proteins. - The immune response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.04,0:40:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beginning trials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.35,0:40:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待中 等待中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pending. Pending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.10,0:40:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败 对象死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Failed. Subject deceased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.24,0:40:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油 加油 加油 - 等待中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, come on, come on. - Pending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.12,0:40:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.94,0:40:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待中 失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pending. Failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.16,0:40:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对象死亡 等待中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject deceased. Pending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.31,0:40:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,方程式计算成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peptide algorithm accepted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.29,0:40:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再生完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regrowth complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.03,0:40:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 生命迹象正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Vitals normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.60,0:40:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,血压正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood pressure normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.58,0:40:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,断肢再生成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Limb regeneration successful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.52,0:40:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extraordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.18,0:40:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.96,0:41:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来见见Fred和Wilma\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet Fred and Wilma…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.48,0:41:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的三条腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}…our three-legged…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.44,0:41:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}…mice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.70,0:41:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.71,0:41:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿小家伙 抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.78,0:41:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.92,0:41:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点 我可不想不小心扎到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, don't want to stick you by mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.42,0:41:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,人体实验要等到下周才开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human trials aren't until next week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.24,0:41:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.91,0:41:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.24,0:41:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我以为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I thought you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.84,0:41:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是忘了什么事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you forget something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.23,0:41:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.90,0:41:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 不要接电话 不过我很高兴你的电话没坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't answer that, but I'm glad to know it's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.91,0:41:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠你姨妈一个道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe your aunt an apology bigtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.33,0:41:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个男子汉一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.36,0:41:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,进屋去 然后道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in there and apologise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.82,0:41:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起梅姨妈 我有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Aunt May, l…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.74,0:41:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, you don't have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.10,0:42:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用跟我道歉 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to apologise to me. It's your…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.34,0:42:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他必须道歉 - 本恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The hell he doesn't. - Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.51,0:42:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我有点事耽误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry, I got distracted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.71,0:42:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 你有事耽误了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, he got distracted. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.58,0:42:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的姨妈 我妻子 大半夜一个人走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your aunt, my wife, had to walk 12 blocks alone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.49,0:42:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,12个街区 然后一个人等在空荡荡的地铁站\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the middle of the night and then wait in a deserted subway station…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.75,0:42:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是因为你忘记去接她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because you got distracted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.96,0:42:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,本恩 亲爱的 说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, sweetheart, honestly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.03,0:42:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以一个人走回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I am completely capable of walking home…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.12,0:42:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要袒护这个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not defend this boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.45,0:42:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是在袒护他 - 你就是在袒护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not defending… - You are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.91,0:42:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听好了孩子 - 嗯 我在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen to me, son. - Yeah, go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.21,0:42:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太像你爸爸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a lot like your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.29,0:42:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个模子立刻出来的 彼得 这是一件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really are, Peter, and that's a good thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.96,0:42:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你父亲有他的人生哲学 还有他自己的原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but your father lived by a philosophy, a principle, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.98,0:42:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信如果你有能力去帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believed that if you could do good things for other people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.67,0:42:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就有这个道德责任去帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you had a moral obligation to do those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.21,0:42:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你生存的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what's at stake here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.60,0:42:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.30,0:42:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.31,0:42:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得挺好的 挺有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is nice. That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.54,0:42:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的都很好 很对 那他现在在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all well and good. So where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.80,0:42:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.42,0:42:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.09,0:43:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在这里亲口告诉我这些难道不应该是他的责任么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't think it was his responsibility to be here to tell me himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.52,0:43:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 你怎么能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, how dare you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.06,0:43:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么敢 你又怎么能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare l? How dare you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.58,0:43:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.92,0:43:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 回来 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, come back here, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.38,0:43:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,本恩 让他一个人待一会儿吧 他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, leave him alone for a little while. He'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.31,0:43:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.94,0:43:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.11,0:43:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.77,0:43:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共2块零7刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's $2.07.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.31,0:44:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是2块零7刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's $2.07.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.35,0:44:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.76,0:44:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挡着后面的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're holding up the line. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.62,0:44:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你可以付一分钱 但你不能从这里拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can leave a penny, you can't take a penny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.12,0:44:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 你可以随时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You can leave…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.69,0:44:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,付给我一分钱 但你要想拿走一分\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a penny anytime, you have to spend 10 dollars…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.29,0:44:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得交十块 店里的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to take a penny. It's store policy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.44,0:44:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你挡着后面的人付钱了 - 我没有2分零钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're holding up my line. - I don't have 2 cents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.84,0:44:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没钱买牛奶就走开 别挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't afford milk, step aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.24,0:44:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸今天没把喝奶的钱给你么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy didn't give you enough milk money today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.58,0:44:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,说2分钱别扯我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just 2 cents…We're talking about 2 cents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.94,0:44:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧让开吧 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just step aside, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.84,0:44:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.11,0:44:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不好玩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, not cool, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.55,0:44:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.94,0:44:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人拦住那个男的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody stop that guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.53,0:44:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 小子 帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid, little help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.11,0:44:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my policy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.75,0:44:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人拦住那个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody stop that dude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.99,0:44:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.95,0:45:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.91,0:45:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人拦住那个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody stop that dude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.16,0:45:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.50,0:45:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢上帝 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.10,0:45:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快叫救护车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call an ambulance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.12,0:45:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人 叫救护车 本恩叔叔 本恩叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone call an ambulance! Uncle Ben, Uncle Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.90,0:45:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢上帝 噢上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.26,0:45:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.30,0:46:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.93,0:46:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.99,0:46:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,目击者画了一张嫌疑人的画像 请你看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witnesses gave a description to the sketch artist. I need you to take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.07,0:46:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.05,0:46:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也料到您并不认得他 女士 凶案组的警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't expect you would, ma'am. Homicide detectives…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.67,0:46:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经在调查了 等等看他们会有什么发现吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are on it. We'll see what they turn up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.35,0:46:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把这个给我么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.76,0:46:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.79,0:46:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事儿 他左手上有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one other thing. He has a star…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.33,0:46:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星形状的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…tattooed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.20,0:46:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on his left hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.36,0:47:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 我知道你最近很不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, I know things have been difficult lately…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.42,0:47:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I'm sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.68,0:47:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我明白你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know what you're feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.03,0:47:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.73,0:47:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别惹我 弗莱舍 - 别这样兄弟 我只是想跟你聊一聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not today, Flash. - Come on, man, I just want to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.92,0:47:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好受点了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels better, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.82,0:47:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叔叔去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, your uncle died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.94,0:47:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.66,0:47:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.51,0:47:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.67,0:48:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.22,0:48:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.21,0:48:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,离他远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.69,0:48:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听见没有 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You understand? - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.70,0:48:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离乔尼远点 - 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay away from Joey. - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.34,0:48:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢打女人是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like beating on girls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.15,0:49:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢打老人是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like beating on old men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.54,0:49:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.32,0:49:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,该干嘛干嘛去\N{\fnArial\fs30}…keep walking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.33,0:49:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是你来的地方 - 你上一次出现在皇后区是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're in the wrong place. - When were you in Queens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.49,0:49:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.78,0:49:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼基 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicky, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.51,0:49:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这把枪么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.57,0:49:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把我也杀了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna kill me too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.22,0:49:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.54,0:49:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.79,0:49:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 哦 别打尼基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, oh, don't hit Nicky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.51,0:49:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.20,0:49:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy is crazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.32,0:49:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.34,0:49:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这儿来 抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back here, man! Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.62,0:49:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.51,0:49:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 包围他 伙计 - 我跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go around, man! - I'll follow you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.94,0:49:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 上 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.44,0:49:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.81,0:49:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃不掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't get away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.67,0:50:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他手臂上有一个星星纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a star tattooed on his left hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.90,0:50:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.49,0:50:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.37,0:50:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你长什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you look like!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.34,0:50:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.55,0:50:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你的脸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen your face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.23,0:51:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上就这点钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.75,0:51:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,都给你 放过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it, take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.85,0:51:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿恶魔生物缆的设计源于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engineered from genetically enhanced spiders…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.60,0:51:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因强化型蜘蛛 其坚韧度无与伦比\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Oscorp's BioCable tensile strength is unparalleled. We're just beginning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.01,0:51:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚开始开发它所有潜在的工业应用\N{\fnArial\fs30}… to understand all the potential industrial applications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.28,0:51:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小钢片就可以安全储存数百米\N{\fnArial\fs30}A single pellet can safely store several hundred metres…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.36,0:51:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,质量轻微的生物缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of the lightweight cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.77,0:51:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.15,0:53:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,13号管区各单位注意 在西19号大街和百老汇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, all units in the confines of Precinct 13, receiving a 10-30…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.95,0:53:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生一起抢劫案\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on West 19th Street and Broadway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.45,0:53:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击者是一名白人男性 35岁上下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assailant is Caucasian male, mid-30s…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.25,0:53:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,体重170到180磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}… 170 to 180 pounds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.76,0:53:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,及肩金发\N{\fnArial\fs30}…shoulder-length blond hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.54,0:53:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后看到他时 他正向东步行赶往19号大街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last seen on foot heading eastbound on 19th Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.66,0:53:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.72,0:53:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有看清他的脸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a description?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.19,0:53:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他带着面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no, he wears a mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.08,0:53:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.29,0:53:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他袭击的大部分人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of his victims…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.55,0:53:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是有前科的重案犯 他们都叫他正义使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are suspects with serious rap sheets. They're calling him a vigilante.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.11,0:53:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他不是正义使者 他是个无政府主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, he's not a vigilante, he's an anarchist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.09,0:53:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人 帮帮我 逮捕我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, somebody! Arrest me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.59,0:53:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.42,0:54:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.71,0:54:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹性纤维 弹性纤维\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spandex. Spandex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.44,0:54:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.72,0:54:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是弹性纤维\N{\fnArial\fs30}…spandex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.66,0:54:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种超凡的速度矢量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extraordinary velocity vector is a function…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.36,0:54:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个质量和加速度的函数\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of both mass and acceleration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.36,0:54:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你比任何人都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you know better than anyone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.97,0:54:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,单摆上悬挂物体的质量对于旋转速度是没有影响的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the weight on any pendulum has no effect on speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.82,0:54:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不影响频率 但是这绝对是一个动量因素\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't affect frequency, but it's totally a factor in momentum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.98,0:55:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 梅姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Aunt May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.57,0:55:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 鸡蛋么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Eggs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.61,0:55:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机鸡蛋 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Organic, got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.00,0:55:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后 如果你要偷车\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the future, if you're gonna steal cars…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.24,0:55:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别穿得像个偷车贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…don't dress like a car thief, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.14,0:55:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么人 警察么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you? You a cop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.61,0:55:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥玩意儿 你真觉得我像是警察吗 哪个警察穿红蓝紧身服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? You seriously think I'm a cop? Cop in a skin-tight red-and-blue suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.90,0:55:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吧 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.95,0:55:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑子是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a mind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.43,0:56:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,被门挤过啊 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of the true scholar, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.05,0:56:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going more for the guys who do the luge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.53,0:56:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意 好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thinking. Good thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.85,0:56:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,从窗户那儿出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.57,0:56:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 你出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.40,0:56:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,夹住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crotch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.39,0:56:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我走 - 这是刀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just let me go. - ls that a real knife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.23,0:56:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 一把真的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's a real knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.31,0:56:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最怕的就是这种小刀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My weakness, it's small knives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.33,0:56:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我走 - 我什么都不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just let me go. - Anything but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.75,0:56:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就怕刀 噢 太没技术含量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…knives! Oh, it's so simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.84,0:56:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帅爆了 - 这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was cool. - What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.62,0:56:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开发的蜘蛛网 我觉得你并不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Webbing I developed. I don't think you want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.23,0:56:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆脱了 让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.15,0:56:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 等会儿 就等一秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, one second. Hold on, one second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.32,0:56:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 伙计 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock it off, man. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.93,0:56:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 让我走 别玩我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let me go. Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.18,0:56:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That isn't funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.42,0:56:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挺好玩儿的嘛 - 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt is kind of funny. - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.79,0:56:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样会更麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could've gone a lot worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.35,0:57:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now hold still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.55,0:57:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝衣男孩在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys in blue here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.54,0:57:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哟 我抓住他了 - 不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yo, I got him. - Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.86,0:57:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他现在哪儿都去不了 - 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not going anywhere. - Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.86,0:57:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.99,0:57:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.73,0:57:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们不明白我戴面具的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one grasps the concept of the mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.84,0:57:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.42,0:57:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚替你们完成了80%的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did 80 percent of your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.03,0:57:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.94,0:57:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就是这样回报我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you repay me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.06,0:57:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在那儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.49,0:57:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这下好玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.77,0:57:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,公交车 晚上好啊 亲们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bus! Hey there, everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.05,0:58:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.91,0:58:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 当心点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, watch out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.12,0:58:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在荡秋千\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm swinging here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.31,0:58:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 38名纽约市警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}So 38 of New York's finest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.42,0:58:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个紧身衣男束手无策\N{\fnArial\fs30}…versus one guy in a unitard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.21,0:58:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I correct?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.43,0:58:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你其实不用等我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to wait up for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.97,0:58:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要等 - 真的不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I do. - No, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.54,0:58:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,用 要等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.91,0:58:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 你去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.42,0:58:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.57,0:58:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡蛋买了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get the eggs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.75,0:58:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 我忘记买了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Forgot the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.90,0:58:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在去买\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get them now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.81,0:59:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 你不需要去买\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you most certainly will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.81,0:59:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,都这么晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at this hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.83,0:59:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.33,0:59:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把帽子摘下来 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off the damn hood and look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.42,0:59:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 你去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter. Where do you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.01,0:59:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁吧你打成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who does this to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.64,0:59:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去睡觉吧 梅姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please go to sleep, Aunt May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.49,0:59:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我 - 梅姨妈 求你了去睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please tell me. - Aunt May, please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.38,0:59:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 求你 去睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…please, please go to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.18,0:59:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不着 你不明白吗 我睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sleep. Don't you understand? I can't sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.22,0:59:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.28,0:59:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密是要付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secrets have a cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.66,0:59:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not for free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.56,0:59:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没有 以后也不会有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, not ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.53,1:00:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,跨种族遗传开始起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cross-species genetics is finally working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.88,1:00:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了蜥蜴的DNA来帮助弗莱迪那条腿的再生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've used the lizard DNA to help Freddy regrow that limb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.39,1:00:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.80,1:00:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是努力研究的成功 也是希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's hard work and promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.89,1:00:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们离灵长类动物实验更近了一步 - 他可没时间等你小步前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a step closer to the primate lab. - He doesn't have time for every little step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.98,1:00:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.64,1:00:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想说他没法等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just mean he can't wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.38,1:00:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 他必须耐心等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he'll have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.65,1:00:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他想成为一只小白鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless he wants to be a lab rat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.22,1:00:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.98,1:00:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.62,1:00:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.26,1:00:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得开始做人体实验了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to start human trials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.29,1:00:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.12,1:00:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不想 也不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't, and no, I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.52,1:00:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 他就必死无疑了 - 人总有一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, then he's going to die. - People die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.00,1:00:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺曼？奥斯本也不例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Norman Osborn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.67,1:00:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我话还没说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.01,1:00:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,人体实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human trials?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.45,1:00:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备上哪儿去找自愿实验者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going to find the people to volunteer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.97,1:00:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说是一个流感疫苗 谁在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as anyone's concerned, it's for a flu shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.25,1:00:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得可以先在退伍军人医院里试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might think the Veterans Hospital is a place to start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.40,1:00:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.91,1:00:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得我在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.40,1:01:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在才觉得震惊愤怒可有点迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little late for shock and indignation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.57,1:01:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟了15年\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 15 years late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.29,1:01:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.23,1:01:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德？帕克把这番话说得正义凛然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard Parker wore it well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.88,1:01:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你说出来就显得虚伪做作了 和当初一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}On you, it's a cheap suit, as it was then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.58,1:01:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和我没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had nothing to do with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.04,1:01:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他的儿子彼得也这么说的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you told his son, Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.69,1:01:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.42,1:01:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道 还是你不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know, or you don't wanna know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.19,1:01:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll remind you what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.74,1:01:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德？帕克也说过你刚才所说的那番话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard Parker said just about the same thing then that you are saying now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.68,1:01:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时间不多了 康纳斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clock is ticking, Dr. Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.69,1:01:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.13,1:01:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.09,1:01:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.10,1:01:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之方程式现在是属于公司的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The formula is ours now anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.97,1:02:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你那条做梦都想长出来的胳膊说再见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say goodbye to that arm you have dreamed of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.94,1:02:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被开除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm shutting you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.97,1:02:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早之前把你的办公室腾出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have your office cleared out by the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.91,1:02:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那些小宠物也可以带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your toys can be taken away too, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.19,1:02:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Freddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.62,1:02:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.01,1:02:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近还好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.99,1:02:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you headed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.19,1:02:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 周一 去玩场地自行车 - 噢 今天是周四\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Monday, B track. - Oh, it's Thursday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.24,1:02:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天周四 - 发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Thursday? - What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.93,1:02:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 你的眼睛 看上去有点淤青\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Your eye, it looks bruised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.40,1:02:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是啊 不 我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, no, I don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.17,1:02:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是得了皮疹之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I got a rash or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.03,1:02:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很严重啊 你去看校医了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad. Have you gone to the nurse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.22,1:02:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢吃柠檬鲈鱼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like branzino?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.96,1:02:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 一种鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, a fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.56,1:02:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I know. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.80,1:02:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you want…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.94,1:02:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以今晚八点去这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you can come to this address at 8:00 tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.17,1:03:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈今晚做柠檬鲈鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom's making branzino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.08,1:03:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.72,1:03:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's apartment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.88,1:03:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,2016号 我没写房间号\N{\fnArial\fs30}…2016. I didn't write that part down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.15,1:03:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why l…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.86,1:03:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我记住了 - 哦 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll remember it. - Oh, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.44,1:04:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.86,1:04:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.00,1:04:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,消防梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.76,1:04:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的门卫有点吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your doorman's intimidating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.23,1:04:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是20层楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 20 storeys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.25,1:04:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.65,1:04:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你的房间 - 嗯 这是我房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is your room. - Yes, this is my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.07,1:04:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.81,1:04:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.86,1:04:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.11,1:04:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你妈妈带了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your mom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.60,1:04:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}…these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.54,1:04:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.02,1:04:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很美 对吧 - 很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beautiful, right? - Beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.68,1:04:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们本来挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.86,1:04:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 很美 - 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, they're beautiful. - I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.97,1:04:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 非常美 它们捆得还挺牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's impressive. They actually held together very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.96,1:05:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是自己留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.43,1:05:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你包里是西装吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your suit in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.74,1:05:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,西装\N{\fnArial\fs30}My suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.69,1:05:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚餐时候穿的正装 难道你就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for dinner. Are you gonna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.88,1:05:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就穿身上这件吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna wear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.45,1:05:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点 - 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's… - Hey, hon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.12,1:05:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.15,1:05:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 这是彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, this is Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.85,1:05:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到您 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.96,1:05:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.51,1:05:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚饭已经好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner's ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.93,1:05:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢柠檬鲈鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you like branzino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.65,1:05:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁不喜欢呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who doesn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.71,1:06:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾玛 我是柯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emma, it's Curt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.52,1:06:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在吗 - 不好意思博士 他不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ls he there? - I'm afraid not, doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.65,1:06:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,司机送他去布鲁克林的退伍军人医院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car is taking him to the Veterans Hospital in Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.85,1:06:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他不能去 艾玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He can't, Emma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.47,1:06:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须阻止他 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop him. He…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.54,1:06:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 但上桥的时候我经常会联系不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would, but I always lose him on the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.52,1:06:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟您保证拉达博士会尽快给您回电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure Dr. Ratha returns your call as soon as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.20,1:07:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去河对面的霍尔顿大道 我赶时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to Holton Avenue, across the river. I'm in a hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.00,1:07:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你要走隧道还是过桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to take the tunnel or the bridge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.67,1:07:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,过桥 从桥上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge! Take the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.48,1:07:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们从桥上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.87,1:07:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you all right…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.83,1:07:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…back there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.02,1:07:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你扭到手了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tweaking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.35,1:07:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.78,1:07:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,开你的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.42,1:07:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.04,1:07:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不太会吃这个鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're having trouble there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.39,1:07:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼头朝那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The head goes on the other…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.31,1:07:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去帮格温的朋友切一下他的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help Gwen's friend with his fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.05,1:07:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, l…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.36,1:07:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.73,1:07:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.44,1:07:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柠檬鲈鱼 - 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Branzino. - George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.91,1:07:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我们讲讲你今天过得怎么样 - 你抓到了那个蜘蛛人嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell us about your day. - Did you catch that spider guy yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.91,1:07:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我们还没抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we didn't catch him yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.51,1:07:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们会的 他是一个闲的无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we will. He's an amateur…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.63,1:07:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢在大半夜袭击市民的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who's assaulting civilians in the dead of night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.35,1:07:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他笨手笨脚 留下不少线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's clumsy, he leaves clues…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.64,1:07:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他仍旧是个危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but he's still dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.84,1:07:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他袭击平民吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's assaulting people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.97,1:07:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.80,1:07:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我看了那段视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I saw that video…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.93,1:07:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他和那个偷车贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with him and the car thief, and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.55,1:08:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得大部分人会认为他在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think most people would say that he was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.01,1:08:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,做公益服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}…providing a public service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.00,1:08:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那大部分人就是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people would be wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.16,1:08:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我想要那个偷车贼从那条街上消失 他就再也不会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted the car thief off the street, he'd already be off the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.14,1:08:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他怎么还在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why wasn't he then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.08,1:08:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来给你讲明白点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me illuminate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.61,1:08:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个偷车贼引出可以帮我们引出\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car thief was leading us to the people who run…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.19,1:08:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,幕后集团 我们已经跟进了半年\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the operation. It's a six-month-long sting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.78,1:08:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是战略 我相信你明白这个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called strategy. I'm sure you're aware of the term?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.51,1:08:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在学校里听过这个词吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've heard about that in school? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.76,1:08:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.05,1:08:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.21,1:08:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他显然不知道你这个计划 - 你好像对这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He didn't know you had a plan. - You seem to know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.67,1:08:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道挺多的 你是不是了解什么内幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a lot about this. Know something we don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.76,1:08:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说你到底是哪头的 - 我哪头也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, Whose side are you on? - I'm not on anyone's side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.83,1:08:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在网上看到一段视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a video on the lnternet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.33,1:08:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在网上看到一段视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw the video on the lnternet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.72,1:08:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 那我们可以结案了 - 哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, then the case is closed. - Well, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.04,1:08:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你看过那个视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you watch the video…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.06,1:08:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我能发你条链接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe send you a link?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.01,1:08:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来他真心想帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like he's trying to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.81,1:08:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在网上他已然被人刻画为一个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the lnternet he's being made out to look like a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.38,1:08:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.90,1:08:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说他是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying he's a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.03,1:08:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你的意思呢 - 他只是想帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you trying to say? - He's trying to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.59,1:08:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是在试着做一些警察做不到的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to do something the police can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.01,1:08:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察做不到的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something the police can't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.82,1:09:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也不知道 - 你以为我们整天在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - What do you think we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.33,1:09:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,围成圈一边吃甜甜圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit around eating doughnuts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.00,1:09:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边摸自己屁股吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with our thumbs planted up our asses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.57,1:09:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔治 乔治 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- George. George. - Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.63,1:09:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 摸啥 - 霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Up your what? - Howard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.87,1:09:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他的立场和您一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stands for what you stand for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.22,1:09:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护那些无辜的人不受坏人欺负\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protecting innocent people from bad guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.89,1:09:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的立场就是捍卫法律和秩序 那是我的立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand for law and order. That's what I stand for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.12,1:09:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白么 我戴着警徽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I wear a badge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.87,1:09:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那家伙戴着面具 像个亡命之徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy wears a mask like an outlaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.26,1:09:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他捉的那群犯人看起来都是一个模子里印出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hunting down criminals that all look the same…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.76,1:09:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像他是为了报私仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Iike he's got some sort of personal vendetta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.11,1:09:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而非保护无辜的人 帕克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's not protecting innocent people, Mr. Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.81,1:09:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去走走吧 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get some air, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.76,1:09:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 我们需要谈谈 - 是的 我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, we need to talk. - Yes, we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.48,1:09:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢您的邀请 如果言语有冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for having me. I'm sorry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.99,1:09:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要见怪 这并非我本意\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if I insulted you. It was not my intention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.00,1:09:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没关系 - 柠檬鲈鱼很美味 斯泰茜夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're welcome. - Branzino was real good, Mrs. Stacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.41,1:09:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢您 - 不用客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.09,1:09:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.15,1:09:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才真要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.66,1:10:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我刚才还以为他会逮捕我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I thought he was going to arrest me at one point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.74,1:10:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不会让他逮捕你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wouldn't have let him arrest you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.29,1:10:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的脸怎么了 - 我有些事要告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to your face? - I wanna tell you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.89,1:10:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.20,1:10:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been bitten…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.65,1:10:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So have l.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.83,1:10:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.14,1:10:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 好吧 我真的要告诉你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay. I gotta tell you this one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.51,1:10:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事是关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta tell you this thing about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.53,1:10:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正义使者和偷车贼的 - 哦 我听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …the vigilante and the car thief. - Oh, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.46,1:10:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.40,1:10:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 我不想谈那个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no. - I don't want to talk about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.85,1:10:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不提了 我不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget that. I won't talk about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.34,1:10:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来谈谈我自己 行吗 - 关于你的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna talk about me, okay? - What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.27,1:10:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可 我希望我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impo… I wish I could just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.23,1:10:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不出口 太难表达了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. It's hard to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.60,1:10:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只管说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.45,1:10:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - Say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.70,1:11:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.15,1:11:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.57,1:11:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不说这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.55,1:11:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.35,1:11:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就是蜘蛛侠 - 别闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're Spider-Man. - Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.36,1:11:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.27,1:11:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.80,1:11:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸想让你进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father wants you to come inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.07,1:11:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.12,1:11:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行吗 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.06,1:11:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.04,1:11:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.25,1:12:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.64,1:12:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.63,1:12:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看发生什么了吗 阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}…find out what is going on, Alfred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.12,1:13:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.90,1:13:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.84,1:13:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.50,1:13:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 上帝啊 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! - I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.29,1:13:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到车里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back in the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.58,1:13:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.55,1:13:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.51,1:14:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.52,1:14:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来个人帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.80,1:14:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 我的孩子被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! My kid is trapped!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.54,1:14:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.72,1:14:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.77,1:14:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 嘿 嘿 - 救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hey, hey. - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.80,1:14:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.34,1:14:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静下来 - 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - Get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.53,1:14:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命 - 嘿 你瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - Hey, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.00,1:14:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是一个普通人 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a normal guy, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.67,1:14:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,想拿着这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna hold this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.50,1:14:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着我的面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold my mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.88,1:14:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.35,1:15:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.20,1:15:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.73,1:15:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 让我把你从这儿弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Let's get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.74,1:15:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你稳住 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stay very still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.43,1:15:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.39,1:15:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.07,1:15:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.08,1:15:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会解开安全带 等会儿你就\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll undo the belt. You hold on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.08,1:15:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧紧抓住前面的座位 我数三声\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to that seat in front of you. On three?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.14,1:15:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 开始了 一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Okay, one, two, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.48,1:15:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 很容易吧 你做得很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how easy that was? You did a great job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.52,1:15:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题了 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.59,1:15:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 快爬上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, climb now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.15,1:15:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我害怕 - 你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't. - Yes, you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.54,1:15:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it on, the mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.21,1:15:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会给你力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna make you strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.61,1:15:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.08,1:15:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.82,1:16:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 伙计 就这样 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. That's it. That's it, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.57,1:16:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在 快爬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now, climb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.05,1:16:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,加把劲 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.42,1:16:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.41,1:16:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬快点儿 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little faster, okay, bud?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.12,1:16:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好 伙计 你做得可棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing great, buddy. You're doing great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.45,1:16:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那样 保持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Keep coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.71,1:16:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.65,1:16:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续爬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.55,1:16:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.25,1:16:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack. Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.32,1:16:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.84,1:16:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.74,1:16:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子 我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son. My son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.98,1:16:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.40,1:16:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.84,1:16:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.05,1:16:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.99,1:17:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.91,1:17:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settle down, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.99,1:17:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 冷静下来 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settle down, boys. Settle down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.01,1:18:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样 - 听着 昨晚大约\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Listen. At approximately…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.20,1:18:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,9点左右 威廉斯堡大桥发生了一起意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}…9 p.m. Iast night, an incident took place on the Williamsburg Bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.04,1:18:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所发生的事情大部分都仅仅是推测而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much of what occurred is speculation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.10,1:18:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 不少人目睹了一起犯罪案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at this point. However, several eyewitnesses…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.13,1:18:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且通过初步调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}… to the crime, as well as our own preliminary findings, have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.89,1:18:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明确有一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…positively placed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.30,1:18:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现在犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}… one individual at the scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.44,1:18:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why, this morning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.29,1:18:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在今天造成申请逮捕证\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I am issuing a warrant…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.82,1:18:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,去追捕所谓的蒙面正义使者 蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}… for the masked vigilante known as Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.39,1:18:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 市议会成员在最初四次会议上会见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And lastly, city council members met with homeowners and airport officials…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.38,1:18:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,房产所有人和机场官员\N{\fnArial\fs30}… in the first of four meetings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.94,1:18:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.36,1:18:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是它会咬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knows how to bite though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.58,1:18:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁知道这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else knows about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.34,1:18:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.81,1:18:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.17,1:18:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.91,1:18:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没相信警方的话吧 没有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe what the police are saying, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.57,1:19:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.86,1:19:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不害怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it scare you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.74,1:19:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you can do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.84,1:19:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.19,1:19:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.39,1:19:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个桥上的东西到底长什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did that thing on the bridge look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.82,1:19:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很大 比人类要大很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was real big. Too big to be human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.04,1:19:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要低调一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta lay low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.55,1:19:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不能那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.59,1:19:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须得那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.12,1:19:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.84,1:19:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为昨晚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.85,1:19:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,桥上的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people on the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.53,1:19:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击他们的东西是致命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever was attacking them would have killed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.21,1:19:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.17,1:19:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须抓住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I gotta go after it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.20,1:19:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.82,1:19:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.13,1:19:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真喜欢跟你接吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really liked kissing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.53,1:19:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的吻技太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an amazing kisser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.07,1:20:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 这个吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, it was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.56,1:20:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说也很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was good for me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.81,1:20:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.19,1:20:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.78,1:20:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.46,1:20:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷偷摸摸可不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not nice to snoop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.50,1:20:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给所有员工放了一周假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave everyone the week off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.75,1:20:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.61,1:21:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是应该在学校吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't you be at school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.95,1:21:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我现在没课\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got a free track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.53,1:21:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to ask you a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.47,1:21:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,捕食者是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would a predator…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.08,1:21:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪到爬行动物的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…track a reptile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.42,1:21:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 它们不需要 大部分爬行动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they don't. Most reptiles are at the top…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.90,1:21:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是位于食物链的上层\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of their food chain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.82,1:21:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是主宰者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kings of their domain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.15,1:21:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也有弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gotta have vulnerabilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.91,1:21:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么突然对冷血动物产生兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the sudden interest in the cold-blooded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.18,1:21:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是问问而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just asking a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.44,1:21:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一些功课\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got school stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.50,1:21:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,涉及到生物学内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biology profiles to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.07,1:21:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}So because of the cold blood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.26,1:21:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些冷血动物会对突然的温度变化做出反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would they react to changes in temperatures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.43,1:21:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得先捉住一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd have to catch one first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.93,1:21:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有听说过吗 有谣言说在纽约出现了新物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know there's a rumour of a new species in New York?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.45,1:21:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽并且巨大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful and quite large.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.94,1:21:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎样知道的 你看过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about it? You seen it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.07,1:21:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看过 但这又不是什么秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not yet classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.14,1:21:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它受到威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it can be aggressive…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.99,1:21:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会变得好战\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if threatened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.72,1:22:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.31,1:22:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没现在这么好过 彼得 从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never been better, Peter. Never been better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.04,1:22:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 如果你不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you'll excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.23,1:22:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得请你离开了 我正在着手新项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid I have to ask you to leave. I have a new project…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.55,1:22:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一个人呆着\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm working on. I need to be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.32,1:22:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Good, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.47,1:22:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.74,1:22:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 帕克先生 我很快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Mr. Parker. I'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.86,1:22:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好事情即将发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful things are coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.18,1:22:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.24,1:22:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.50,1:22:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长先生 如果有一只巨大的恐龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Mayor, if there was a giant dinosaur…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.15,1:22:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,四次乱窜 我一定会第一时间通知您的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…running around you would be the first to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.72,1:22:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以告诉你的儿子 他好好休息了 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell your son he can rest easy, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.42,1:23:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们都如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You and me both, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.57,1:23:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.15,1:23:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克先生 你为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Parker, why are you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.89,1:23:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没在学校 - 我没课\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …not in school? - Got a free track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.04,1:23:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是这样 我不能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.58,1:23:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快点把话说完吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So make your point quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.16,1:23:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 在曼哈顿四处乱跑的可能不是恐龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, there may not be a dinosaur running around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.36,1:23:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是更危险的东西 我知道是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something more dangerous, and I know who.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.81,1:23:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道是谁 - 柯蒂斯·康纳斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know who? - Dr. Curtis Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.75,1:23:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个生物学家 - 奥斯的那位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a biochemist. - Of Oscorp?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.14,1:23:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 康纳斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - Dr. Connors…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.22,1:23:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是我女儿的导师 你说的就是他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who's my daughter's mentor. Is that who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.39,1:23:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是他 - 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the one. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.40,1:23:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近 康纳斯博士帮格温写了一封大学推荐信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recently, Dr. Connors gave Gwen a college recommendation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.90,1:23:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那文笔太美了 看得我都哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was beautiful. When I read it, I cried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.98,1:23:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你现在要我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have me believe that he…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.62,1:23:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他cos成恐龙的样子到处跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is running around dressed up like a dinosaur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.79,1:23:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是cos 也不是恐龙 他是把自己改造成一只巨大的蜥蜴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not dressing up and not a dinosaur. He has transformed himself into a lizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.58,1:23:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先问你一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.18,1:23:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看起来像东京的市长吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like the mayor of Tokyo to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.83,1:23:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在告诉你千真万确的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you the absolute truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.08,1:23:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个男人一生都在做交叉物种的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man has worked for his whole life on cross-species genetics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.13,1:23:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没了一条胳膊 所以努力想让它重新长出来 但那方程式并不均衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lost an arm, he tried to grow it back, but the equation was imbalanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.27,1:23:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,导致他变成了一只蜥蜴人 他在使用蜥蜴的基因\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has turned into a lizard. He's using lizard DNA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.72,1:24:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他非常危险 而且他现在在策划一些可怕的事 我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is dangerous, and he is planning something horrific. I know. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.89,1:24:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right, I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.10,1:24:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接下来就这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what we'll do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.63,1:24:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回去陪东京市民游山玩水\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll go back to hanging out with the citizens of Tokyo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.59,1:24:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我就回去保护我们这座\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go back to protecting the citizens…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.47,1:24:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of this fine, fair city of ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.41,1:24:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴特勒警官 你可以帮我送帕克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant Butler, please escort Mr. Parker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.61,1:24:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回学校吗 - 斯特西队长 我并不是来捣乱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …back to school. - Captain Stacy, I'm not messing around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.71,1:24:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带过来询问他 打电话叫他来 一定要叫他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just bring him in. Just call him in. You have to call him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.72,1:24:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a danger to everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.13,1:24:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 相信我 - 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just, please, listen to me. - Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.27,1:24:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.96,1:24:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手头上有的柯蒂斯·康纳斯的所有东西都给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me everything we have on Dr. Curtis Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.01,1:24:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行吗 现在就要 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? Right away. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.72,1:25:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验对象 柯蒂斯·康纳斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject: Dr. Curtis Connors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.94,1:25:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,体温89.7\N{\fnArial\fs30}Current temperature: 89.7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.88,1:25:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳定48小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady for 48 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.20,1:25:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液分析显示 淋巴细胞和单核细胞的文本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood panels reveal lymphocyte and monocyte readings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.97,1:25:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,都包含以往的主体的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}…consistent with subject's past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.37,1:25:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凝血速度迅速提高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clotting rate vastly improved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.19,1:25:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,肌肉反应 力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marked enhancement…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.93,1:25:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵活性\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in muscle response…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.12,1:25:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有显著提升\N{\fnArial\fs30}…strength and elasticity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.61,1:25:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,视力得到相应改进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyesight similarly improved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.81,1:25:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验对象无需再佩戴视力矫正镜片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject no longer requires corrective lenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.50,1:25:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是寻找治疗疾病的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no longer about curing ills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.03,1:25:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.11,1:25:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找完美物种之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}…finding perfection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.91,1:26:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试阻止旧病复发\N{\fnArial\fs30}In attempt to redress regenerative relapse…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.36,1:26:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,剂量增加到200毫克\N{\fnArial\fs30}…dosage has been increased to 200 milligrams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.84,1:27:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾阻止我一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stopped me once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.62,1:27:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次 你不能再阻扰我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't stop me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.88,1:27:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一天比一天强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting stronger every day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.70,1:28:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 真要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that sucked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.53,1:28:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得？帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.16,1:29:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.68,1:29:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.03,1:29:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑光明正大地进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…consider coming in through the lobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.96,1:29:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 我爸爸总觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, my father is under the impression…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.44,1:29:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是时候该去看看心理医生 - 哦 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …that you require psychiatric attention. - Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.24,1:29:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.14,1:29:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.40,1:29:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外一个人比我还惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see the other guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.50,1:29:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个人 他突然从人变成了一只巨大的蜥蜴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other guy, in this instance, being a giant mutant lizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.92,1:29:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 格温 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Gwen, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.06,1:29:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要杯可可吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want cocoa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.42,1:29:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍华德泡了一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard's making some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.65,1:29:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 爸爸 我不想喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dad, I do not want cocoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.64,1:29:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 我已经17岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I'm 17 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.58,1:29:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.77,1:29:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我记得上周不知道是谁说 她总是幻想住在巧克力房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remembered somebody saying her fantasy was to live in a chocolate house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.20,1:29:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不现实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's impractical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.81,1:29:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且会变胖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fattening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.91,1:29:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧克力房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chocolate house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.93,1:29:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉爸爸 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, Dad. - It's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.75,1:29:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能喝可可 因为我现在有些事忙着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have cocoa right now because I'm work…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.88,1:30:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在忙着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.24,1:30:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我痛经了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have cramps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.11,1:30:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在很难受 而且有点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel kind of pukey and just sort of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.31,1:30:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是有点情绪波动 就像在哭一样 - 好吧 我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like, emotional. I keep crying. - It's okay. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.10,1:30:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样 - 痛得很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. - It's brutal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.86,1:30:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不会想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.49,1:30:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那种感觉就像 - 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's, like, bad. - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.09,1:30:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢理解 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, Daddy. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.98,1:30:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 见习骑师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, Bug Boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.31,1:30:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚叫我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you call me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.78,1:30:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.48,1:30:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有事 有事 - 没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No. - Yes. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.71,1:30:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.33,1:31:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.55,1:31:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天 我记得的每一天 我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day, for as long as I can remember, my father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.16,1:31:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天早上的时候都会出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has left every morning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.26,1:31:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把徽章别在胸口\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and he's put a badge on his chest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.01,1:31:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,腰上戴着他的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and strapped a gun to his hip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.35,1:31:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后每天 自从记事开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every day, for as long as I can remember…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.30,1:31:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直担心他就这样一去不回\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I haven't known if he was gonna make it home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.71,1:31:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.69,1:31:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.00,1:31:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.80,1:31:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我必须阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta stop him, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.17,1:31:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不这样做 因为是我创造了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to, because I created him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.25,1:31:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.04,1:31:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把方程式给了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave him an equation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.72,1:31:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我造成了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that made all of this possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.44,1:32:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸之前研究过一些东西 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something my father had been working on, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.60,1:32:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密地 现在我明白他为何要保密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secretly. Now I realise why he kept it a secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.45,1:32:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键在于 这是我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is, this is my responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.36,1:32:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须弥补这个过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.47,1:32:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.14,1:32:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.18,1:32:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去透透气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.56,1:32:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是去透透气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.57,1:32:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一会 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for a minute. Can we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.13,1:32:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不行 - 来吧 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No. - Yeah. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.16,1:32:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 真的不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.28,1:32:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.76,1:32:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果被我父母看见 我就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my parents see me leaving, I'm dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.67,1:32:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母不会看见你离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents aren't gonna see you leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.99,1:33:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得？帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.25,1:33:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.18,1:33:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是唯一需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the one who needs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.60,1:33:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.71,1:33:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再感到孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no more loneliness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.40,1:33:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再被孤立\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no more outcasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.05,1:33:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,物种广泛分布可以促进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Species-wide distribution could enhance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.44,1:33:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类进化过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}…humanity on an evolutionary scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.69,1:33:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,适者生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}One has to adapt to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.60,1:33:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 如果可以像蛇那样蜕变 也许我就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That, changing like the snake, I might be free…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.44,1:33:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆脱肉体对我的禁锢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to cast off flesh wherein I dwell confined."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.08,1:33:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经放弃了吗 终于知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you give it all up after all you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.13,1:33:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的能力所及\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you can do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.55,1:33:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所感受到的这些力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the power you feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.47,1:33:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can save…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.05,1:33:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}… them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.07,1:33:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不允许你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.57,1:33:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,打乱我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}… the way of my plan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.99,1:34:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得？帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Peter Parker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.06,1:34:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.78,1:35:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无处可逃 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nowhere to hide, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.39,1:35:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些流离失所的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these souls…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.85,1:35:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Iost and alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.14,1:35:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以拯救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can save them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.31,1:35:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以治愈他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can cure them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.85,1:35:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need to stop me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.41,1:35:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.80,1:35:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑子糊涂了 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not thinking straight, doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.01,1:35:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停止 这并不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop this. This isn't you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.46,1:35:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.84,1:35:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.73,1:36:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.83,1:36:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to talk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.86,1:36:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下你会懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.09,1:36:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.72,1:36:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…make me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.21,1:36:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.89,1:36:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…hurt you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.79,1:36:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.47,1:36:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.64,1:37:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会把你从这儿扔到窗外 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna throw you out the window. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.27,1:37:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人变成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's been…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.89,1:37:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜥蜴怪物啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}a bad lizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.25,1:38:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是纽约警局的威廉副队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Lieutenant Williams from the New York City…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.48,1:38:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经将这座大楼包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Police Department. We've got this building surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.55,1:38:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进前进 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha, let's move ahead. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.66,1:38:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.02,1:38:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.14,1:38:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在下水道里追踪他 我会在他伤人之前阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the sewer, tracking him. I gotta stop him before anyone gets hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.62,1:38:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们需要解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we need an antidote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.06,1:38:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道怎样制作血清吗 - 我一直在做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know how to run a serum? - I do it all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.28,1:38:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 太棒了 实在太棒了 我需要你去奥斯集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, great. Okay, I need you to go to Oscorp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.78,1:38:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去找到交叉物种的文件 那是蓝色的血清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to access the cross-species file. It's a blue serum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.86,1:39:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,12389号档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}File 1 2389.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.13,1:39:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.37,1:39:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.00,1:39:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个科学家 我终其一生都在创造一个没有缺陷的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent my life as a scientist trying to create a world without weakness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.33,1:39:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会被抛弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}… without outcasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.33,1:39:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想创造更强壮的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sought to create a stronger human being…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.38,1:39:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这并不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but there's no such thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.51,1:39:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类都只是软弱 可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human beings are weak, pathetic, feeble-minded…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.92,1:39:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,无力的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}… creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.46,1:39:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么还要生而为人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why be human at all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.06,1:39:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们可以变得\N{\fnArial\fs30}… when we can be so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.18,1:39:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}…much more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.60,1:39:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,更快 更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster. Stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.92,1:39:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,更聪敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.36,1:40:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我给你们的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my gift to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.83,1:40:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oscorp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.74,1:40:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯特西队长 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain Stacy! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.45,1:40:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们确定目标位置了 长官 那蜥蜴人正在朝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a confirmed sighting, sir. The Lizard's headed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.83,1:40:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坚尼街车站走去 - 那蜘蛛侠呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …toward Canal Street. - What about Spider-Man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.20,1:40:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在学校里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside the high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.25,1:40:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要抓住蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that Spider-Man off the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.48,1:42:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜥蜴这种生物放出生物剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lizard creature has released a biological agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.37,1:42:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,制止他的行动都失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All efforts to stop him have failed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.09,1:42:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在7号大街上往北走\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and he is now proceeding north on 7th Avenue. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.28,1:42:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.74,1:42:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 嗨 我在奥斯集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, hi. I'm at Oscorp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.17,1:42:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在就离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get out of there now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.72,1:42:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 解毒剂正在制作中 - 噢 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The antidote is cooking. - No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.38,1:42:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳斯在路上了 他很快就到你那里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connors is on the way. He's coming to you right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.80,1:42:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要那个放射设备 他想让整个城市都感染病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs the device. He's gonna infect the whole city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.63,1:42:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下8分钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight minutes left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.75,1:42:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都告诉你了 你还准备在那里待8分钟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wait eight minutes after what I told you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.57,1:42:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are gonna to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.63,1:42:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is an order, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.64,1:42:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把大家都带出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get everybody out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.86,1:42:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就没有听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear wh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.18,1:42:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温 他妈的 你是认真的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen! Gwen! You Mother Hubbard. Are you serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.01,1:43:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他朝南边走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heading south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.09,1:43:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 否则我们就开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down now, or we will open fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.24,1:43:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经被包围 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are surrounded. There is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.90,1:43:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法逃脱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.60,1:43:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.66,1:44:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.62,1:44:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear up top!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.62,1:44:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就位 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.94,1:44:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,各就各位 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear here, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.30,1:44:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.75,1:45:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴到地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.32,1:45:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手放到头后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hands behind your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.04,1:45:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.80,1:45:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.25,1:45:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正在往奥斯集团走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's headed to Oscorp!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.64,1:45:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女儿现在就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your daughter's there right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.58,1:45:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.80,1:45:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.26,1:45:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 保罗 但如果没看见 我是不会相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Paul, if I didn't see it, I wouldn't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.72,1:45:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会冒险说这话 如果那个东西不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't venture to say what it is crawling up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.11,1:45:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,往奥斯塔楼的北面爬上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the north side of the Oscorp Tower…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.48,1:46:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但记住 它不是人类 并且它十分强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but clearly it is not human and it is very, very strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.80,1:46:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩余时间 1分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time remaining: one minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.27,1:47:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,血浆准备完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antidote complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.88,1:47:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.33,1:47:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们获得最新消息 这是刚刚才收到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting the latest details. This is just coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.84,1:47:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约警察要求撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}The New York Police Department…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.57,1:47:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,第54大街南部的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has called for a city-wide evacuation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.97,1:47:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切人员车辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}…everything south of 54th Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.74,1:48:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在第54大街以南\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are south of 54th Street…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.95,1:48:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你立刻从那里离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you have to move out of the area immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.61,1:48:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来 蜘蛛侠在前往奥斯集团赶去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man appears to be heading towards Oscorp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.46,1:48:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks injured…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.37,1:48:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他是否可以做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it's really not clear if he's gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.38,1:48:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the guy who…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.16,1:48:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在桥上救了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…saved my boy on the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.45,1:48:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,特洛伊 他们让我们撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Troy, they're clearing us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.43,1:48:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,市中心有什么事情发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something bad's going down in Midtown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.67,1:48:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你的朋友马修斯 是那个在第6大道开吊车的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still friends with Matthews, that crane operator on 6th?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.97,1:48:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 让他接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Get him on the phone for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.87,1:48:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察正在疏散所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cops are evacuating everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.35,1:48:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让他接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him on the phone for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.09,1:48:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 查理 给我接通第54大街的Enriquez\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Charlie, get me Enriquez on 54th Street!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.03,1:48:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道了 - 安吉洛 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it. - Angelo, get your mug over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.01,1:49:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃斯基 你得加班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolski! You're getting some overtime!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.87,1:49:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有塔式起重机都在第6大街\N{\fnArial\fs30}All tower cranes on 6th…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.67,1:49:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们的吊臂伸过街道 吊杆调整到90度\N{\fnArial\fs30}…swing your jib arms over the avenue. Boom angles at 90 degrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.51,1:49:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些大家伙成排的举高帮助蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man needs those big boys high and lined up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.35,1:49:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他提供畅通的道路 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's give him a clear approach. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.12,1:49:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.66,1:51:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.49,1:51:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.75,1:51:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要把这个给蜘蛛侠 - 快上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to get this to Spider-Man. - Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.05,1:51:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它能阻止蜥蜴人 - 上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt can stop the Lizard. - Get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.54,1:51:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不明白 - 不 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't understand! - Yes, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.15,1:51:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个面具男是你的男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boyfriend is a man of many masks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.52,1:51:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.90,1:51:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.26,1:52:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.74,1:52:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定别让他受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please make sure he's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.24,1:52:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,加纳利装置正在初始化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initialising Ganali device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.96,1:52:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detonation in T-minus two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.55,1:53:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的彼得？帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Peter Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.38,1:53:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有妈妈 没有爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No mother, no father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.25,1:53:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,连叔叔也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.24,1:54:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}All alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.85,1:54:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.36,1:54:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时45秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detonation in T-minus 45 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.92,1:54:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.89,1:54:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gift from Gwen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.84,1:54:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付它 你快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this, Peter! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.27,1:54:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.65,1:54:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,30秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}…30 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.50,1:55:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detonation in T-minus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.70,1:55:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,10秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}… 10 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.33,1:55:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.36,1:55:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.66,1:57:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}The captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.14,1:57:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.47,1:57:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜥蜴博士它\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.89,1:57:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.09,1:57:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们阻止了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stopped him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.74,1:57:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.38,1:57:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你离开这儿 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you out of here. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.77,1:57:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 慢点 慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.52,1:57:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.53,1:57:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救援队就快到了 - 你必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help's on the way, okay? - You need to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.89,1:57:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须在他们来之前 离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to be gone when they get here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.36,1:57:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.25,1:57:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.67,1:57:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错怪你了 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong about you, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.78,1:57:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个城市需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This city needs you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.09,1:57:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.95,1:57:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.73,1:57:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有人对你怀有敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna make enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.00,1:57:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们也因此而受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will get hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.52,1:58:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候甚至是那些你最亲近的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes the people closest to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.39,1:58:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以答应我一件事 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I want you to promise me something, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.21,1:58:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把格温牵扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave Gwen out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.63,1:58:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.84,1:58:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.38,1:59:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}An eerie calm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.67,1:59:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,笼罩了整个纽约市\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has set in over New York City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.55,1:59:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎有一些粉状的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, some sort of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.24,1:59:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,雾化解毒剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}…aerosolised antidote was launched from…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.22,1:59:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从奥斯塔洒下 目测这些粉状物直接抵消了生物毒素\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Oscorp Tower, which seems to have counteracted the biotoxins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.25,1:59:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼哈顿下城区的居民可以回复平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Residents of Lower Manhattan can rest peacefully…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.98,1:59:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这次恐怖事件的策划者\N{\fnArial\fs30}…knowing that the alleged mastermind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.73,1:59:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯蒂斯·康纳斯教授已被逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}… of this terror plot, Dr. Curtis Connors, is behind bars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.59,2:00:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？奈尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got John Niles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.05,2:00:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在曼哈顿下城区为您播报\N{\fnArial\fs30}… on the street for a report in Lower Manhattan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.18,2:00:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, what do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.74,2:00:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, it's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.11,2:00:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.18,2:00:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.03,2:00:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙了一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.66,2:00:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.64,2:01:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.34,2:01:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.65,2:01:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.39,2:02:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚举行了葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a funeral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.62,2:02:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们鸣枪致敬 发表悼词\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shot off rifles and they made speeches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.10,2:02:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位老师也去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of my teachers showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.47,2:02:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱舍 弗莱舍也去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flash…And Flash showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.81,2:02:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你 所有人都去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone was there but you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.84,2:02:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.11,2:02:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能去 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this, I can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.54,2:02:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.70,2:02:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.02,2:02:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.27,2:02:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再和你见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see you any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.14,2:02:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.12,2:03:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让你答应他 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made you promise, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.03,2:03:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此远离我\N{\fnArial\fs30}To stay away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.67,2:03:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'd be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.50,2:03:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么美的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a pretty girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.47,2:03:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.88,2:04:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,本恩叔叔也这么说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what Uncle Ben said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.60,2:04:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你约她出去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ask her out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.07,2:04:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.38,2:04:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.11,2:04:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.09,2:04:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我在一起对她不会幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just no good for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.01,2:04:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得？帕克 她只要和你在一起 就会幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Parker, if there's one thing you are, it's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.54,2:04:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何对此有怀疑的人都可以找我谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone has a problem with that can talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.12,2:04:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 我知道最近事情多有不顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, I know things have been difficult lately, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.04,2:04:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对此很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.62,2:04:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know what you're feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.49,2:05:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你还是个孩子的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since you were a little boy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.18,2:05:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的生活就一直伴随着那么多的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been living with so many unresolved things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.97,2:05:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 曾经有人说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, take it from an old man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.15,2:05:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些让我们陷入低谷的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}those things send us down the road, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.08,2:05:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会成就我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make us who we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.61,2:05:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人注定要成为伟大的人 那一定是你 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if anyone's destined for greatness, it's you son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.53,2:05:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是上天赐予你的礼物 你必须弄明白如何使用它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe the world your gifts, you just have to figure out how to use them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.86,2:05:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道无论它将你带出多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}And know that wherever they take you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.48,2:05:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都一直在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll always be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.73,2:05:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 回家吧彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}So come on home Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.78,2:05:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的英雄 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my hero and I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.86,2:05:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 帕克 - 嘿 还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello Parker. - Hey, how's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.38,2:05:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,进展不错 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming along, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.22,2:05:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这衣服真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a cool shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.00,2:06:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.04,2:06:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那男的够牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}dude's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.24,2:06:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是小妞都喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But chicks dig him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.15,2:06:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一位教授曾经告诉过他的学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a professor once who liked to tell his students that there were only{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.76,2:06:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的小说都逃不脱十种剧情\N{\fnArial\fs30}ten different plots in all of fiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.70,2:06:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我告诉你们他错了 剧情只有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I'm here to tell you he was wrong, there is only one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.12,2:06:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.37,2:06:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克先生 你又迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Parker, tardy again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.34,2:06:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 至少你还是来上课了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least we can always count on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.32,2:06:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 瑞特女士 不会有下次了 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry Miss Ritter, it won't happen again, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.77,2:06:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别许你做不到的承诺 帕克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make promises you can't keep, Mr. Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.89,2:06:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但承诺是最好听的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but those are the best kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.98,2:06:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了同学们 打开课本 我们从第一页开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay class, open your books, let's begin on page 1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.40,2:09:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.87,2:09:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你告诉那个男孩了吗 - 告诉他什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you tell the boy? - Tell him what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.68,2:09:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于他父亲的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell the boy the truth about his father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.98,2:10:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 那真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Well that's very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.14,2:10:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在差不多是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll let him be for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.32,2:10:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该离他远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should leave him alone!{\r}
